WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.229
- So what did you mean,

00:00:01.229 --> 00:00:03.780
I saw that you recently said you thought

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:05.669
the world had retired you.

00:00:05.669 --> 00:00:07.748
- Well, I think, you know,

00:00:07.748 --> 00:00:09.790
this is not a business that is

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:13.510
particularly kind to aging.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.480
And I was blowin' along,

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.930
just doin' one show after
the other for a long time.

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:23.880
And then all of a sudden,

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.300
I just kinda couldn't get arrested.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:27.250
- Yeah.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.406
(audience laughs)

00:00:28.406 --> 00:00:30.450
I hear that from a lotta
women more than men.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:31.380
- Well, yeah.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.530
- Yeah, it's like crazy.
- Yeah.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.080
- Yeah, I do get upset, though,

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.865
'cause I feel like men,

00:00:36.865 --> 00:00:38.720
they get the salty gray hair look

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.950
and it's like, oh sexy.

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:41.874
And then women, and it's like, mm.

00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:43.760
(audience laughs)
- Not so much.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:45.120
- Like it didn't work as well,

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.570
but yeah.
- I went gray for awhile.

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:49.677
I was like, "I'm not
dyin' my hair anymore.

00:00:49.677 --> 00:00:50.510
"I'm not gonna do it."

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:52.530
- But I actually love
you gray in the show.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:54.100
- But you know, I got a lotta blowback.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.520
It was like, really?

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.000
You wanted this?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:57.833
- [Kelly] Really?

00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:59.110
- Yes, I did.

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:01.123
- Oh, your name is Meemaw.

00:01:01.123 --> 00:01:03.470
(audience laughs)
- I know, but that's a wig.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:04.303
- [Kelly] Yeah, I love it.

00:01:04.303 --> 00:01:06.170
It's like, I love it.

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:07.613
It's very Emmylou as well.

00:01:07.613 --> 00:01:09.093
- Yes.
- Emmylou Harris, yeah.

00:01:09.093 --> 00:01:12.100
- I was just listenin'
to her new album today.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.030
- I love her.
- 80 and unbelievable.

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.570
- Unbelievable, I can't even
believe I've heard her live.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:20.410
I feel like blessed, but let's
talk "Ghostbusters" as well.

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:21.330
So what's the new film?

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:22.570
How's it going, is it good?

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:25.570
- It, well, I haven't seen anything yet.

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:27.160
But we have completed it,

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.710
and I think it's gonna be pretty,

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:30.543
- I'm excited.

00:01:30.543 --> 00:01:31.570
- Fabulous.

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:32.403
(audience applauds)
- I mean, it's just

00:01:32.403 --> 00:01:34.340
another thing we all grew up with.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:35.250
I love it.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.850
Everything you touch is golden.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.600
I don't know why you have
a problem or had a problem.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.220
- I have been awfully lucky.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:42.900
- You, I feel the same way.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:43.860
Blessed, super blessed.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:44.780
It's nice to know that,

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:46.200
and you know that you're blessed, too.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.033
- Yeah.

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:48.030
- It's cool, it's grounding.

